# Passenger Ferry ({3}, 4/3 Vehicle, crew 2): "Whenever this Vehicle attacks, you may pay {U}. When you do, another target attacking creature can't be blocked this turn."
# On turn 3 Bot1 crews it by tapping Grizzly Bears (summoning sick, power 2) and attacks with the Ferry, Savannah Lions and Ornithopter. Paying with Mox Pearl's {W} does not pay {U};
# Mox Sapphire's does. The target must be another attacking creature: the Ferry itself, the tapped non-attacking Bears and Bot2's Ornithopter are refused; the Lions are chosen.
# Bot2's Ornithopter may not block the Lions (CR 509.1b) but blocks Bot1's Ornithopter (the control: the others stay blockable), so the Ferry and the Lions connect: Bot2 is at 14.

